{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_title", "source_sha256": "6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191", "ja": "プロローグ", "zh": "序幕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1000_president", "source_sha256": "25feb9e6805c6bbad141ed990de68aaa0735fa54280c70153c7908f44b8ddda9", "ja": "うーむ。いやはや、\nこれはどうしたものか……。", "zh": "唔──嗯，伤脑筋了。\n这可要怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "c70b7a0ea2b869113da17842d57f04ca74e0f30e01b08ec8e8a5cff1e44120b0", "ja": "あ、社長さん、おはようございます♪\nお困りのようですけど、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "啊，社长，早安♪\n你看起来好像很烦恼，请问发生了什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1002_president", "source_sha256": "46c9c483575e0deeb07372ce36a9e092718ac4dab7ef00177def526f2ac10923", "ja": "おお、青羽君じゃないか。おはよう！\nいや、実は困ったことになってしまってね……。", "zh": "哦哦，这不是青羽吗，早安！\n哎呀，其实我遇到麻烦事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1003_president", "source_sha256": "296a61dc86a9dc9cb24ced5c9e243f578a40342448bfb99992ad9d7230d7a3fd", "ja": "次回公演のための大切な楽譜を、その……\n海にポチャンと落としてしまったのだよ。", "zh": "我把下次公演需要的重要乐谱……那个……\n给掉到海里去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "708aa777ccc7d37c944592790c2e9127f138cd8727ee52b799b18a6cac3c7f03", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか！？\nそんなぁ……！", "zh": "咦？是这样子吗！？\n怎么会这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "ff47b82afec96027007c0d33bed6580255e1e07e63ff6e27d1ca99f32ad60dc3", "ja": "いつもは沈着冷静で、とってもダンディな社長さんが、\nどうしてそんなウッカリなことを……？", "zh": "总是沉着冷静又有绅士风度的社长，\n怎么会犯下这种冒失的错误……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1006_president", "source_sha256": "604d49b47a93f841d19af2e9215ee90e0b95b253a95786a4e843acad5d71a2ef", "ja": "そ……それはだね。なんというかその……\nそう、海から怪獣が現れたのだよ！　なんちゃって！", "zh": "那……那是因为啊，该怎么说才好，就是……\n没错，是因为海里出现怪兽了！才怪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "016a0cacc758eaf17089b58d7081d2e7a826f1b4865ca027628c3943276f5bba", "ja": "えええっ、海から怪獣が現れたんですか！？\nそれじゃ、楽譜を落としても仕方ありません……。", "zh": "咦咦咦，海里出现了怪兽吗！？\n这样的话，弄掉乐谱也是难免的呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "b4eeb48d8f5c0ba6068047cf595c88b9b2ebad424f619741a0c52f4f0bdda528", "ja": "……青羽君？", "zh": "……青羽？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "da054469a17a7708aff84cdf94a536aaa683ee4e02bd2498358edc026ceda44e", "ja": "でも、社長さんがご無事で何よりでした。\nえへへっ♪", "zh": "不过，最重要的是社长平安无事，真是太好了。\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "fee867f3c6d85680ea58f22517c07af07b490350d34278b6d9d2b02cf1bd3dd2", "ja": "青羽君……！", "zh": "青羽……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "ea57505e096f9806431f7b1a887cf0588637e640b9772fa380820fcdc13e60fa", "ja": "それで、落とした楽譜はどうなったんですか？", "zh": "结果，掉到海里的乐谱怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "44f341b6e774495e6a870d050068aa5d2dc1e29fb92f2be7bc57fa124f1f9725", "ja": "あ、ああ。それが残念ながら、\nそのまま海の底深くに沈んでしまったようだ。", "zh": "啊、嗯。很遗憾，\n乐谱似乎就那么沉到海底深处了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "0eeed7983e75659cacc5f7f30978efc37bda95f10259e008826151fb969e8246", "ja": "これから釣竿を持って集めに行こうと思っていたんだが\n……こんな時に限って、持病の腰痛が……あいたたた。", "zh": "我本来打算等一下去拿钓竿，把乐谱都钓回来……\n但我腰痛的老毛病，偏偏在这时候发作……痛痛痛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1014_102mis", "source_sha256": "542b29d75957873dfd4bbf65193dd9dbd76498dca9be872cb6e6a57e3c5a78a7", "ja": "わかりました！\nそれじゃ、私が釣ってきます！", "zh": "我知道了！\n那么，就我去钓吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "558383181c50ee5b9ceecf818a14137044ef957972eba4dbf97b302ea7d7c201", "ja": "なんとっ！　青羽君が？\n釣りは得意なのかね？", "zh": "什么！青羽要去钓？\n你擅长钓鱼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "f4487dadd32e9320803227bb94380a2fcc820f7d89e29f1f63625ba28ddae377", "ja": "はい！　こう見えても子供の頃は、地元の海釣り\nコンテストで入賞したこともあるんですよ♪", "zh": "是的！别看我这样，其实我小时候参加过\n故乡的海钓竞赛，而且还得过奖呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "d9322193342e998bf11d0b24dbbdede2e6caa7ef9555c377114e95684dd98b6f", "ja": "おお、君にはそんな才能まであったのか！\nやはり、面接でピンと来た私の目に狂いはなかった！", "zh": "哦哦，原来你有那方面的才华啊！\n我在面试时就直觉非你不可，我果然没看走眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "c6574fd34df53970689e8bd03188e16204b343e329cbd9a6208c8a2774f81ce0", "ja": "では青羽君、すまないが私の代わりに、\n楽譜を釣ってきてくれたまえ！", "zh": "那么，青羽，不好意思，\n你就代替我去钓回乐谱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "b6e2f88079111dfb5f9430b41b0fc3ce241da545e9c0f08cdc1f682da4790f16", "ja": "譜面は全部で7つある！\nひとつ、よろしく頼む……いや違った！", "zh": "乐谱总共有七张！\n这一次就拜托你……不对，说错了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "cea6fdd534cb43bc15899ee2a1d7713783619d50ae81445030d68e7cac7b7c7f", "ja": "7つ、よろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "是七张乐谱就拜托你啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "season_b_003_tunapro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "season_b_003_tunapro_1021_102mis", "source_sha256": "fbb4b00de8759accddf03e1769c0c58b721f17a5dedebbdd034aa73480a4ae9d", "ja": "は～い！\n青羽美咲、一生懸命がんばります♪", "zh": "好的～！\n我青羽美咲，会全力以赴的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
